### Get All Subjects
GET {{url}} HTTP/1.1

### Find subject by id
GET {{url}}/4 HTTP/1.1

### Create subject
POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "New Subject",
  "description": "favourite subject"
}

### Create subject Bad
POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "subjectId": 1,
  "name": "",
  "description": ""
}

### Update subject
PUT {{url}}/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "subjectId": 2,
  "name": "Newton",
  "description": "update"
}

